<h1>Work at Pest Tech</h1>
<p class="lede">Pest Tech is always looking to hire A-grade attitudes. None of this is rocket science, but we will train new team members the skills they need.</p>
<hr>
<h2>Customer Service Technician</h2>
<p>This position delivers onsite customer service that inspires referrals. We’re looking for people who enjoy building relationships, who want flexibility in scheduling, and who can solve problems independently.</p>
<p>We spend most of the day performing inspections and using modern technology to protect homes from bugs. Employees must be reliable, independent, and organized.</p>
<p>Our ideal candidates are articulate and empathetic.</p>
<p>We provide lots of ingredients for success:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Above average compensation, with no formal qualifications or education requirements.</li>
  <li>Training program for technical skills and customer service</li>
  <li>Paid Vacation, Paid Holidays, and paid Sick Days</li>
  <li>Opportunities for advancement in position and compensation</li>
  <li>Company vehicle</li>
  <li>Reimbursements for gym memberships, uniforms, and other job needs</li>
  <li>Supplemental insurance (dental/vision, accident, etc)</li>
</ul>
<p class="small">Pest Tech Chattanooga LLC provides equal opportunity for equal talent. Background checks and MVR reports are required of new employees.</p>
<h2>How to apply</h2>
<p>No portal, no forms. Text <a class="phone-inline" href="sms:{{ site.phone.tel }}">{{ site.phone.display }}</a> with your name and a couple sentences about yourself, and meet <a href="/team">the crew</a> you'd be joining.</p>
